  "description": {
    "raw": "You imbue a slashing melee weapon with the ability to create a bleeding wound. As a free action when the weapon hits a living creature, the wielder can discharge this spell to add 1 point of bleed damage to the weapon’s base damage. This bleeding is difficult to stop; add your spellcasting ability modifier (Wisdom for clerics, and so on) to the DC to stop the bleeding.",
    "search_text": "\"you imbue a slashing melee weapon with the ability to create a bleeding wound. as a free action when the weapon hits a living creature, the wielder can discharge this spell to add 1 point of bleed damage to the weapon’s base damage. this bleeding is difficult to stop; add your spellcasting ability modifier (wisdom for clerics, and so on) to the dc to stop the bleeding.\"",
